{"id":"246c089e11e34935","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-outermost-redex-position.md","title":"最外红项位置","display":"df-outermost-redex-position — 最外红项位置","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-outermost-redex-position","aliases":["56-df-outermost-redex-position"],"display":"df-outermost-redex-position — 最外红项位置","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.3.2","source_printed_pages":"131,509","source_ocr_blocks":[152,530],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-outermost-redex-position"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-outermost-redex-position</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-outermost-redex-position — 最外红项位置"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131,509"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>530</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>；严格前缀关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 及位置集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R,t):=\n\\{p\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t):\n\\neg\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(q\\prec p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R,t):=\n\\{p\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t):\n\\neg\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(q\\prec p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本定义适用于一般TRS；一个位置最外，当且仅当没有红项严格包住它。不同最外位置互不为前缀，因此两两平行。最外指项树中靠近根的包含关系，不能误用字典序最小来代替；字典序只负责从多个最外位置中进一步选最左者。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 固定，$\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t\\in T$；$\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]；严格前缀关系 $\\prec$ 及位置集见 [[56-df-position]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t\\in T$；$\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]；严格前缀关系 $\\prec$ 及位置集见 [[56-df-position]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R,t):=\n\\{p\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t):\n\\neg\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(t)\\;(q\\prec p)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1597,"backlinks":[{"id":"11b60d6a0ba187b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]] 的正交系统，采用 $\\operatorname{Res}_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{src},\\operatorname{tgt},\\rho|_i$。$\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)$ 见 [[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]。$\\operatorname{ExternalRed}_R$ 独立定义于所有 $s\\in T$。两个外部性谓词的局部红项参数为 $s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；$\\operatorname{ExtTo}_R$ 另取局部路径参数 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$，$\\operatorname{External}_R$ 的路径由内部量词绑定。"},{"id":"3242e584655817b0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]] 的正交系统，$\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$、$\\operatorname{pos}$ 沿用其接口。$\\operatorname{InfRed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$\\mathcal E_R$ 见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s)$ 见 [[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]。两个链谓词分别以 $\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u,\\boldsymbol c\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$、$i\\in\\mathbb N$ 为局部参数；单步残余图 $\\operatorname{GRes}^{1}_R$ 的变量独立由其集合构造绑定。"},{"id":"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 与规则集 $R$ 如 [[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]；$\\operatorname{OuterPos}$ 也见该节点。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-outermost-redex-position.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a3b60e1e9cdeef27","da02033e6d596cae","a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}